    "0.98a": "11/11/2025 - the day I remembered that this mod exists lol\n\nUpdated to the most recent game version. Did a balance pass across ships/wings. Added station tags.\nVanilla+ no longer touches the Rampart or Guardian and doesn't boost hull/armour of other ships as much.",
